{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"7e0c0a0d58a797ab","type":"group","x":-2560,"y":-990,"width":8720,"height":5070,"label":"Diagram"},
		{"id":"4b6146846dced108","type":"group","x":-2320,"y":-870,"width":1000,"height":4830,"color":"2","label":"home.njk"},
		{"id":"e7909fc651df070f","type":"group","x":-440,"y":-870,"width":600,"height":4830,"color":"#ffffff","label":"Document lifecycle + asset loading (time ↓)"},
		{"id":"448f957f3c49eb70","type":"group","x":3200,"y":160,"width":1560,"height":1340,"color":"3","label":"Preloader.js"},
		{"id":"9156ab32d26e6dd3","type":"group","x":1920,"y":830,"width":440,"height":3135,"color":"6","label":"AnimationDirector.js"},
		{"id":"6635b6019d88958b","type":"group","x":920,"y":1735,"width":440,"height":2280,"color":"5","label":"preloader.njk (view state)"},
		{"id":"b38154b7a42b86eb","type":"group","x":-2120,"y":1295,"width":440,"height":720,"color":"4","label":"session-management-script.njk"},
		{"id":"e031edfdd45bc44f","type":"group","x":-360,"y":655,"width":440,"height":440,"label":"📍document lifecycle complete"},
		{"id":"b1fed3582d68bce3","type":"group","x":-360,"y":-265,"width":440,"height":390,"label":"📍HTML parsing completes"},
		{"id":"dd24012f7bc82cb3","type":"text","text":"#3 · Unlock at `exit`, not after the outro (S)\n`unlockScroll()` sits in `finally`, after `runExit` awaits the logo (`--preloader-step-stagger`×2 + step = 0.8s). Unlock and dispatch `preloader:out` as soon as `exit` is set; the fade-out plays over an already-scrollable page.","x":3540,"y":2425,"width":420,"height":170,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"6e4d68efcb1b68f3","type":"text","text":"#4 · Await the gates together (S)\nGates are serial: `fontsReady` → `directorReady` → hydrate → `videoPlaying` → `intro`. Only the outro needs all of them. `Promise.all` them so the *slowest* gate bounds the splash, not the sum.","x":2560,"y":2419,"width":420,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"e01f793b935174e5","type":"text","text":"#6 · Narrow the font gate (S)\n`document.fonts.ready` waits on every started face, including Google Plex (2 cross-origin round trips). Gate on `document.fonts.load('1em DraftPaper')` only — 8 KB, already `preload`ed; Plex is `display=swap` anyway.","x":2560,"y":2610,"width":420,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d49523193269227c","type":"text","text":"#2 · Soften the `playing` gate (S)\n≤4000ms is the largest single gate, and on slow links it is the one that trips. The poster is already painted (eager fetch at parse). Gate on `loadedmetadata`/`canplay` — or not at all — and fade the video in on `playing`.","x":2560,"y":2807,"width":420,"height":170,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"810d1b7452ea3c3d","type":"text","text":"📍EVENTS.system.directorReady (≤8000ms)","x":2560,"y":2270,"width":400,"height":50,"color":"#000000"},
		{"id":"faa7368fa935ad5d","type":"text","text":"📍EVENTS.system.directorReady (≤8000ms)","x":5080,"y":2625,"width":466,"height":50,"color":"#000000"},
		{"id":"a9bfb51186b53001","type":"text","text":"#5 · Skip the idle wait (S)\n`requestIdleCallback(initDirector, {timeout:150})` adds up to 150ms while the splash is already up and the page is locked. Call `initDirector` directly once the bundle evaluates.","x":1440,"y":1320,"width":420,"height":130,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"6fa0388290abb975","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/views/templates/partials/head/head-load-sequence.canvas","x":-2280,"y":-800,"width":880,"height":400},
		{"id":"8374ce108ea4af53","type":"text","text":"third-party fonts block render","x":-1200,"y":-630,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"4f5a9f2b51a077b7","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/views/pages/home/home.md","subpath":"#^ecb8b3","x":-2120,"y":-100,"width":400,"height":130,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"d8a78fc270ba0f14","type":"text","text":"📍Preloader.js module evaluated","x":-2120,"y":77,"width":400,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"eb639df84245d4c4","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/views/pages/home/home.md","subpath":"#^3c1561","x":-2120,"y":218,"width":400,"height":90,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"8873fdc5d91397e1","type":"text","text":"📍body-end module runs — `import(bundle.js)` *started*","x":-2120,"y":360,"width":400,"height":80,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"9869e2b56385d8df","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/views/pages/home/home.md","subpath":"#^60f6f2","x":-2120,"y":525,"width":400,"height":205,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"a6465878b99aa618","type":"text","text":"📍bundle evaluated — GSAP plugins registered (no `window.gsap`); `scheduleInit()` → `requestIdleCallback(initDirector, {timeout: 150})`","x":-2120,"y":790,"width":400,"height":145,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"1f4974cd15dc3481","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/views/templates/partials/session-management-script/session-management-script.md","subpath":"#^e36dca","x":-2100,"y":1354,"width":400,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"be45e0bfdd87e42d","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/views/templates/partials/session-management-script/session-management-script.md","subpath":"#^204f8f","x":-2100,"y":1504,"width":400,"height":97,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"902668ce68040888","type":"text","text":"### Defect — hide never fires\n`head.njk` runs this script before `<body>` is parsed, so `document.querySelector(\"[data-preloader]\")` is `null` (rendered `_site/index.html`: script precedes the element). Return visits still play the full outro. The script's own comment (\"right after the landing header\") is stale.","x":-2100,"y":1664,"width":400,"height":331,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"8de2eaa28603be80","type":"text","text":"📍IBM Plex / Cormorant woff2 from `fonts.gstatic` — requested once the Google CSS parses and text matches a face (`display=swap` → fallback text paints first)","x":-340,"y":155,"width":400,"height":80,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"deedfbc1eab94334","type":"text","text":"## 📍DOMContentLoaded (event)\nFires as soon as the head/body module scripts have run — the bundle is still in flight (its fetch starts at the same ms as DCL, measured). Bundle evaluates after; `scheduleInit` sees `readyState !== \"loading\"` and calls `requestIdleCallback(initDirector, {timeout: 150})` directly.","x":-340,"y":265,"width":400,"height":265,"color":"#ffebeb"},
		{"id":"0f0019f988483d6b","type":"text","text":"📍favicons + `manifest.json` — lowest priority, idle fetches","x":-340,"y":560,"width":400,"height":65,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"da41a9bb4fa4b05b","type":"text","text":"`</html>` reached","x":-340,"y":-220,"width":400,"height":65,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"08bafec7f2f7b08b","type":"text","text":"📍body parse — Sanity `poster=` images + `<img data-card-el=\"image\">` (no `loading=lazy`) fetch eagerly; award logos `loading=\"lazy\"` wait for viewport proximity","x":-340,"y":-510,"width":400,"height":105,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"490a85e2e8b8e7f1","type":"text","text":"📍`<video data-defer-video data-src>` — **no fetch**: `src` is absent during parse, so no media request on the critical path","x":-340,"y":-375,"width":400,"height":80,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"e2ff58550bad1b97","type":"text","text":"## readystatechange = interactive\n`readystatechange`. Parser done, DOM complete. Module scripts run in document order: `Preloader.js` (`<head>`), then the body-end script that *starts* `import(bundle.js)`.","x":-340,"y":-120,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"06b4e96b751bdae3","type":"text","text":"## readystatechange = complete\n`readystatechange`. complete → `load` (event)\n\nAll subresources done (Sanity images, sizzle poster/video). Measured 166–317ms on home — typically *before* Director boot finishes; nothing in the preloader waits on it.\n\nDeferred videos are **not** counted — they have no `src` yet.","x":-340,"y":700,"width":400,"height":270,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"0b7a07a6be0a0069","type":"text","text":"## load(event)","x":-340,"y":1000,"width":400,"height":65,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"af725728d9138fbc","type":"text","text":"### 📍 FCP\nFirst contentful paint: paint-timing entry, not a lifecycle state. Not ordered against `interactive`: the first frame renders once CSSOM + DOM allow; on home the parse (~50–110ms) usually finishes first. CSS intro starts here.","x":-340,"y":1125,"width":400,"height":130,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"72ff4e2c95433b7d","type":"text","text":"📍`hydrateDeferredVideos()` — `video.src = data-src; load()` (`preload=metadata`). Hero background mp4 + card videos request **now**, after `director:ready`; background `play()` pulls the full stream","x":-340,"y":1285,"width":400,"height":105,"color":"#5e99d9"},
		{"id":"c81ec4770b723dfb","type":"text","text":"📍HTML parsing begins — `index.html` response streams; head assets are discovered by the preload scanner in document order","x":-340,"y":-850,"width":400,"height":90,"color":"#ffffff"},
		{"id":"2c59021781419891","type":"text","text":"#1 · Hydrate before the gates (S)\n`hydrateDeferredVideos()` runs only after `fonts.ready` **and** `director:ready`, so the hero mp4 request waits on DCL → bundle eval → idle ≤150ms → constructor. Call it before `await fontsReady()` (or inline `src` + `preload=metadata` on the hero video only) so the fetch overlaps the whole boot.","x":-1075,"y":1085,"width":420,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"6232cc6aa1cfa867","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/views/organisms/status/preloader.md","subpath":"#^20d161","x":940,"y":2023,"width":400,"height":1210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"0d1fba341dce2678","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/views/organisms/status/preloader.md","subpath":"#^e31b11","x":940,"y":3360,"width":400,"height":110,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c78c85606fbc087d","type":"text","text":"📍**hidden** — `preloader.hidden = true` once the logo's fade lands (≤1000ms).","x":940,"y":3585,"width":400,"height":100,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"08cc4ec0eac39ff3","type":"file","file":"dataink.io/frontend/views/organisms/status/preloader.md","subpath":"#^f53317","x":940,"y":1783,"width":400,"height":105,"color":"4"},
